1610
02:15:30,881 --> 02:15:32,963
33 marks total.

1611
02:15:33,685 --> 02:15:35,927
That's going to slip him well down the Becky odd here.

1612
02:15:35,948 --> 02:15:38,570
1234567 more to go.

1613
02:15:38,610 --> 02:15:43,216
Could easily go from second down into seventh place here, possibly eighth.

1614
02:15:44,429 --> 02:15:47,014
Lee Fen Yang of New Zealand 3.3.

1615
02:15:47,394 --> 02:15:52,604
We'll see next three divers all do this in slightly different varieties.

1616
02:15:52,623 --> 02:15:55,028
The next two divers do it in slightly different varieties of this.

1617
02:15:55,890 --> 02:15:57,573
Back three and a half somersaults with tuck.

1618
02:15:58,173 --> 02:16:00,918
Next diver James Denny will do it in the pike position.

1619
02:16:04,087 --> 02:16:05,369
Oh, that's good from Lee.

1620
02:16:05,770 --> 02:16:06,652
That's how you do it.

1621
